  "goodToKnow": "Die Koordinate is a coordinate, usually used in the plural: GPS-Koordinaten, die Koordinaten eines Punktes. In maths, das Koordinatensystem has an x-Achse and a y-Achse. The verb koordinieren means to coordinate (activities), and der Koordinator is a coordinator. Pronounce both o's separately: ko-or-di-NAA-te. From Latin co- + ordinare (to arrange). Plural: die Koordinaten."
